  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjdivddkgUA6t-t5o6BMHOYml1hI0ffdEgfjwiZMnSbu94VcnMiEKR6eiaod7vK_LOXrGkHcATsj9WlVV-KJ8q6u7I9vVoDs7V6mHtMA-EGvuYXPWezH4An4_GWYB5Hw7agI35_VQ7KnsFmvHyyWa7eAjGVwgC_VrHVzy726o5kcNmgAtIay-urcOsgL_M/s1024/Designer%20-%202024-12-17T181957.202.jpeg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"כבשים תאומות במרעה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjdivddkgUA6t-t5o6BMHOYml1hI0ffdEgfjwiZMnSbu94VcnMiEKR6eiaod7vK_LOXrGkHcATsj9WlVV-KJ8q6u7I9vVoDs7V6mHtMA-EGvuYXPWezH4An4_GWYB5Hw7agI35_VQ7KnsFmvHyyWa7eAjGVwgC_VrHVzy726o5kcNmgAtIay-urcOsgL_M/w320-h320/Designer%20-%202024-12-17T181957.202.jpeg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מבחן אמריקאי&nbsp;</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">תמונת הפוסט עשויה לעזור (או להפריע😀) לפתרון שאלה 2.</span><br /></span></div><p></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מה זה \"בקנה אחד\"?</span><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יונים בקן</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">באותו גבעול</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קנה מידה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עוֹלוֹת מִקֶּנְיָה</span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">2. מה זה \"אחו\"?</span><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מקום מרעה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נמצא מאחורי</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">איחור קיצוני</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אחים תאומים</span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">3. מה זה \"שדופות-קדים\"?</span><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">משתחווים</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חסר תקדים</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רזות במיוחד</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מוכות יובש</span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">4. מה זה \"חִמֵּשׁ\"?</span><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צִיֵּד</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יָצָא לְחָמְשׁוּשׁ</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אדם שחום עור&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">'חמאס' בפרסית</span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">5. מה זה \"צפנת-פענח\"?</span><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">'מלך כביר' בלטינית</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מפתח עם ציפוי סיליקון</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מפצח אגוזים&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פותר סודות</span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">6. מה זה \"לשבור-בר\"?</span><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">להזמין שרברב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לשבור איזה דבר</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לרכוש מזון&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שבת בר-מצווה</span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">7. מה זה \"מתנכר\"?</span><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מתנהג כמו זר</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אדם שמרבה לנחור</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מנמנם \"מנקר\"&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קר מאוד</span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">8. מה זה \"אמתחת\"?</span><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נמצא מתחת</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אמת אחת</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מתוח&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שק</span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">9. מה זה \"חמש-ידות\"?</span><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חמש ידיות</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פי חמש</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פשטידות תימניות</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שק</span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">10. מה זה \"כסף-משנה\"?</span><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כסף כפול</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מטבע כסף מתקופת המשנה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הכסף לא משנה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תקציב שנתי</span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div></div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></h2></div><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מצאו את הביטויים המקראיים השזורים בידיעות הבאות:</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ציטוט מ'גלובס' (1):</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"></span></p><blockquote><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אורלי ממן, הממונה על קבילות הציבור בתאגיד השידור \"כאן\", קובעת כי הראיון שערך ירון דקל עם חברו הפוליטיקאי גדעון סער אינו עולה בקנה אחד עם הקוד האתי של התאגיד</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1; margin-block: 0.5rem 1rem; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: right;\"></p></blockquote><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1; margin-block: 0.5rem 1rem; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"text-align: right;\">ציטוט מ'גלובס'</span><span style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</span>2:</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><blockquote><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">את חטאי אני מזכיר היום. אני הוא שהכנסתי את נתן זך לטרקלינה של ספרות, ואולי משום כך זיכה אותי והכניס את שמי בשירו</span></blockquote><p></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">ציטוט מ'דה מרקר':</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><blockquote><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">המבוטחת ניסתה לחסוך לכלל ביטוח תשלום תביעה - וזו השיבה לה רעה תחת טובה</span></blockquote><p></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"text-align: right;\">ציטוט מ'</span>דבר':</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><blockquote><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תקציב המדינה - דממה דקה: התקציב הדו-שנתי יאושר השבוע, ולא נודע כי יש אופוזיציה</span></blockquote><p></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\">ציטוט מ'הספרנים'</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large; text-align: justify;\">:</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><blockquote><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וכן מזהיר האבא את בני המשפחה לשמור על הבן הקטן לבלתי הניח אותו להידדות בחצר, פן יקראנו אסון מן הסתיו ומקור הזמן, ופן תיפול עליו לבנה מן הקיר</span></blockquote><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h2><div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: large; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 חוטם<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 הספרה הראשונה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שירת גבורה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מאכל בהמה (מהפרשה)\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מקובץ\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 קצה\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מפתן</span></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><ol><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li></ol><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גלובס 1: עלה בקנה אחד</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גלובס 2: את חטאי אני מזכיר היום</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">דה מרקר: רעה תחת טובה</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">דבר: ולא נודע כי</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הספרנים: פן יקראנו אסון</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">אף, אפס, אפוס, מספוא, אסוף, סוף, סף</span></p></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><br /><br /><br /></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>"
}
